| [sukualam/trofeo-lcd](https://github.com/sukualam/trofeo-lcd) | Rust driver port | GPL |
| [haven80/trofeo-lcd-rs](https://github.com/haven80/trofeo-lcd-rs) | Rust driver + second-monitor approach | GPL-3.0-or-later |
| [habibrehmansg/infopanel](https://github.com/habibrehmansg/infopanel) and [emaspa/infopanel-1](https://github.com/emaspa/infopanel-1) | Thermalright panel support + protocol notes | GPLv3 |

